      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pyrmont%2C_New_South_Wales",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The historic Pyrmont Fire Station, designed by Walter Liberty Vernon in 1907, stands on Pyrmont Street as a reminder of early civic architecture.",
